    {
      "text": "Peel garlic and place in a blender."
    },
    {
      "text": "Wash, dry, and juice lime into the blender."
    },
    {
      "text": "Add cottage cheese, shredded cheese, salsa, and chili powder to the blender. Blend on high for several minutes until smooth, scraping down the sides of the blender as needed. Add water, 1 tablespoon at a time, if needed, to reach desired consistency."
